  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "保健室",
    "id": "34",
    "timezone": "3"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「そお……っと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「うん、誰もいないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ふう、ようやく保健室に辿りつけたの。新校舎のほうは久しぶりだから、かるく迷子になってしまったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「苦労したの。油断すると、いかりんぐが『ぶちょ～っ☆』って言いながら襲いかかってくるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「エンカウント率が高すぎなダンジョンなの。命がいくつあっても足りないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「おっと。誰もこないうちに、やることやっちゃうの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ん～、ずいぶん以前とは様変わりしてるの。どこに何があるのか、よくわからないの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「何これ、どうしてお茶っ葉とか聖書とかが置いてあるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「えぇっと、救急箱は……ひゃっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「び、びっくりしたの。あなたは、ん～？　どこかで見た顔のような？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あっ、思いだしたの。こないだ旧校舎で会った、転校生の男の子なの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ほんとに、うちの生徒だったのね。うちの学校に男の子がいると、ふしぎな感じなの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あなた、保健室に何か用事でもあるの？　どこか、怪我でもしたの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ふぅん、保健委員のお手伝いをしてるの？　色々やってるのね、あなた？　お疲れさまなの♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「じゃあ知ってるかな、救急箱ってどこにあるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あぁ、そこにあるのね。ほんとにもう、情けないの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたし新校舎には滅多にこないから、転校生くんよりも学校について無知になってるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あのね。ちょっと怪我しちゃったから、手当てをしたかったの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「でも知らないひとに触られるのは苦手だから、自分でやろう、と思って救急箱を探してたの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「たいした怪我じゃないしね、自分でできるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あわわっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「な、なぁに？　あぁ、あなた手当てしてくれるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ありがとうなの。あなた、優しい子なのね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「このへん、怪我してるの。うん、いちおう消毒して包帯を巻いてくれたらいいの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「いかりんぐ……あぁ、うちの水泳部の子にね、噛まれちゃったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「甘噛みだったけど、むずむずするの。噛みあとが残ってると、恥ずかしいしね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ほんと、いかりんぐは困ったさんなの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あの子、わたしを見つけるとものすごい勢いで追いかけてきて噛むの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「入部したときからそうなの、もはや病気なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「愛情表現、なんだろうけど。わたしには、そんな愛は重すぎるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「おかげで、あの子からビクビクと逃げ惑う毎日なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あなた、あの子……いかりんぐと仲良しっぽかったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ちょっと、あんまり他人を噛まないように言い聞かせておいてくれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしが言っても、聞いてくれないの。どうせ、どうせ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「とはいえ、いつまでも噛まれっぱなしでは部長としての面目が丸つぶれなの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「自衛策を、講ずるべきだとは思うの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「野生動物は外敵に補食されないために、棘を生やしたり固い甲羅で身を守ったりするの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あとは、毒なの。毒があれば、外敵も食べようとはしないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「わたしの肌に毒を塗っておいて、いちど噛まれるの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それで酷い目に遭えば、いかりんぐも二度とわたしを噛もうとは思わないの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「ナイスアイディアなの……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「な～んて、冗談なの。毒なんか肌に塗ったら、こっちが病気になっちゃうの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それに、毒なんてそう簡単に手に入らないの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「えっ、転校生くん？　何それ、保健委員の一年生がつくった料理……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「それが毒として使えるかもって？　りょ、料理なのそれっ？　ドドメ色してるけどっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「あわわっ、近づけないでほしいのっ！　どう見てもそれはマジもんの毒なのっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「命の危機をおぼえるのっ、わたしはまだ死にたくないの～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 63,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 16,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "うしお",
    "text": "「うわぁん、意地悪！　もう嫌なのっ、旧校舎に帰るぅ～っ！」"
  }
]